# Input/focus suite binaries.
#
# These are listed BY NAME, as every entry above is, and the temptation to
# collapse the list into `tests/test_*` should be resisted: the sources are
# `tests/test_*.nim`, so that glob ignores the suites themselves. This repo's
# sibling learned the general version of that lesson the hard way — a bare
# `*map` pattern matched any path component ending in "map" and hid a whole
# `keymap/` directory from git. Prefer a longer explicit list to a clever glob.
tests/test_input_focus
tests/test_gui_keyboard
